            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "StreedsFeeds"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic!--I increased the amount of garlic, coarsely chopped it (versus mincing it) and let the shrimp marinate in it for a little while before grilling.",
            "datePublished": "2006-10-26T15:54:50.297Z"
