              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Momof2"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was really good, but I did do a few things differently. I added just a bit of chicken stock and some lemon juice. It made the butter sauce a bit thicker and stick to the shrimp better. It tasted great and I know I will be making this again. Thanks for posting.",
